.TH geectl-local-build-periodic-uninstall 1  "geectl-local-build-periodic-uninstall 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-local\-build\-periodic\-uninstall \- Remove the daily periodic cleanup for this platform: disable the scheduler entry, then remove its files. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the uninstall
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl local\-build periodic\-uninstall\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove the daily periodic cleanup for this platform: disable the scheduler entry, then remove its files. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the uninstall
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
